{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","满满"],["/description_i18n/cn","一个不怎么靠谱的战士，普通攻击有小概率造成高额伤害。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","满满！已经准备好了！"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","The acorn knight is ready for battle!"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","满满！想到一个！超棒的点子！"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Awesome! Uh, I mean- Chippy is grateful."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","上啊！仓鼠侦查团！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Onward, fellow knights!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","啊！啊！呜哇！"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","A knight... never admits... defeat..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","耶！呼！我们赢了！"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","For the glory of all knights!"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","是满满、满满的幸运值！"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_i18n/en","Chippy is at your service!"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","满满会跟上你的。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","看我的橡果剑法，吓死我了。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","大家都去哪儿了，嗨，我在这里！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","哇，这是满满最喜欢的东西！主人最了解满满了！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","只要是主人送的，满满都喜欢！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","多莉小姐，主人！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","最近的冒险很精彩！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","要很多很多葵花籽！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","外面下雪了！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","主人，隆冬节快乐！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","哇，有怪兽！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","主人，春焰庆快乐！"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","梅林不止一次吩咐跟随在侧的满满不需要太过拘束，但是满满依旧坚持着主人与骑士之间的礼仪，而不像漫漫那样直呼梅林其名。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","满满曾向卢修斯讨教该如何成为一名出色的骑士。几小时后，卢修斯不得不紧急将他送至医师身旁——满满试图驯服一匹烈性野马，并光荣负伤。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","作为使魔的满满刚刚被召唤不久，曾偶然在街边看到耀光骑士团凯旋而归，人民在为他们欢呼呐喊。那个瞬间，他第一次有了想要成为骑士的念头。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","满满有个不愿被外人知晓的称号：幸运鼠。因为他在密集的箭雨中往返送信数次，却都没被射中。仓鼠骑士拒绝承认这是运气所致，而将成果归功于——实力！"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","“那只毛茸茸的小东西？虽然不太聪明，却意外地很有忠勇。有他陪伴着梅林，我也能稍稍安心了。”——灰烬魔女米瑞尔"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","满满曾仔细地研究过霍根的步态，因为他也想拥有“领袖走路的英武感觉”。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","许下成为骑士的愿望后，满满开始使用人类的剑与盾练习，每次都被过沉的铁盾压倒在地。解救满满数次后，梅林委托矮人工匠给他打造了现在的小型武器。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","漫漫曾有一整天没见到满满，后来才发现因为别人的几句夸奖，满满替抱病的守城卫兵巡逻了一整天。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","满满的思维就像手中的短剑一样笔直且难以弯折，他往往会根据自己的第一印象，迅速将遇到的人分为两类——好人，或坏人。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","满满借过许多英雄冒险史诗，但因为他认得的字实在有限，大部分书最后都是漫漫念给他听的。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","说起来，最开始见到阿尔萨时，我吓了一跳呢！就看到一个球形从远方向我们滚来……"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411010.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 满满 & 阿尔萨 & 索恩"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","好了吗？烤肉好了吗？"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411020.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 索恩 & 阿尔萨"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","说到吃的话，沙漠里的旅人树果还不错……噜噜呢？有爱吃的食物吗？"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411050.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 噜噜 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","远处武斗场的呼声又传来了，你们听到了吗？"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411130.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","阿尔萨 & 满满 & 曼卡拉"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","赏金猎人这行，有个笑话。"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412050.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","瓦尔克 & 满满 & 索恩"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","主人，如果有一天满满和你分开了，你会不会想满满？"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412100.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","满满"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","等一下，你不能拿走我的水壶，那里面可是我从集市淘换来的好水，一点沙子都没掺。"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412150.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","阿德 & 满满 & 瓦尔克 & 萨忒娜"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","安丹德拉为什么在休息时经常闭上眼睛？好像也没在睡觉……"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412160.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 安丹德拉"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","呼哧、呼哧……"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411050.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","嘿，仓鼠小骑士，你还好吧？怎么一脸马上要昏过去的样子？"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411090.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","辛巴达 & 满满"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/cn","漫漫，你在写什么呢？"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411100.json"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 漫漫 & 辛巴达"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/cn","有句话怎么说的来着？“欲言又止时，就像吞了只蜥蜴，却留了截蜥蜴尾巴在嘴边……”"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411110.json"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/cn","辛巴达 & 满满 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/12/preview_i18n/cn","魔法师大人，为什么盯着我的铁头瞧？"],["/interaction_records/12/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411120.json"],["/interaction_records/12/title_i18n/cn","呼金 & 漫漫 & 满满"],["/interaction_records/13/preview_i18n/cn","除了你，村子里应该还有和你年龄相仿的年轻人吧？"],["/interaction_records/13/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411130.json"],["/interaction_records/13/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 辛巴达"],["/interaction_records/14/preview_i18n/cn","唔，这些熏鱼好好吃！"],["/interaction_records/14/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411140.json"],["/interaction_records/14/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/15/preview_i18n/cn","小水村的遭遇真是令人难过。我们能不能帮忙做点什么呢？"],["/interaction_records/15/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411150.json"],["/interaction_records/15/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 满满"],["/interaction_records/16/preview_i18n/cn","主人，漫漫，你们有看到吗？"],["/interaction_records/16/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411160.json"],["/interaction_records/16/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/17/preview_i18n/cn","魔法能让人死而复生吗？"],["/interaction_records/17/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411190.json"],["/interaction_records/17/title_i18n/cn","索尼娅 & 满满 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/18/preview_i18n/cn","看不出来呀，你们这两个小家伙，居然能经历那么多冒险。"],["/interaction_records/18/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411200.json"],["/interaction_records/18/title_i18n/cn","辛巴达 & 满满"],["/interaction_records/19/preview_i18n/cn","满满捡到了很多漂亮的羽毛！"],["/interaction_records/19/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411220.json"],["/interaction_records/19/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 索尼娅 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/20/preview_i18n/cn","说实话，我也不是没出过海，但这次的冒险也太不一样了！"],["/interaction_records/20/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411240.json"],["/interaction_records/20/title_i18n/cn","辛巴达 & 漫漫 & 满满"],["/interaction_records/21/preview_i18n/cn","嘻嘻，才不给你呢，这是给索尼娅姐姐的！"],["/interaction_records/21/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411250.json"],["/interaction_records/21/title_i18n/cn","奈拉 & 满满 & 索尼娅 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/22/preview_i18n/cn","我小时候当过乞丐、小偷、扒手。甚至为了一口面包，和野狗打架。"],["/interaction_records/22/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411260.json"],["/interaction_records/22/title_i18n/cn","索尼娅 & 漫漫 & 满满"],["/interaction_records/23/preview_i18n/cn","索尼娅，满满在废墟里找到了这个！好像是血薇帮的标志！"],["/interaction_